  m_text: 'Desktop: WASD move, mouse look, center crosshair

    Hold Left Click:
    grab / drop

    Right Mouse Drag: free rotate held part

    Mouse Wheel: rotate held part

    R: cycle rotate axis

    Shift + Wheel: move held part closer / farther

    F: reset held rotation flat

    Backspace: respawn held / last grabbed part

    Esc:
    unlock cursor


    VR: headset/controllers if connected

    No headset: XR
    Device Simulator uses keyboard/mouse to drive virtual remotes'
